{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":68482,"seasonNumber":5},"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":5,"episodeCount":12,"posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1659614","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"夏の眩しい日差し、きらめく海の水面。そこに不釣あいな土下座する女子高生。顔を上げた彼女・天見ヨーコは友人のマリナ、ノンへ一緒にバイトをしようと頼み込む。そこへ見知らぬ2人組の女子高生が通りかかり……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/1"},{"id":"1659615","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"数日前、ヨーコはうだる空気の中、足早にとある場所へ向かっていた。そこはレイニーカラー。父親の天見浩司が経営する小さな喫茶店だ。旅行準備中の父へ猛烈な勢いで抗議するヨーコだったが、現れたレインに驚き――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/2"},{"id":"1659616","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"レイニーカラーの店内で父・天見浩司から説教を受けているヨーコ。珍しく怒っている浩司は、ヨーコへ「レイニーカラーで働きながら人の役にたて」と課題をだす。そしてヨーコは店の常連である女の子・芽留と出会うのだった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/3"},{"id":"1659617","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"マリナとノンへ泣きつくヨーコ。事情を説明し終わり、夏休み中一緒にレイニーカラーで働こうと頼み込む。どうにか説得し二人と共に店頭へたつ初日。用意されていたコスチュームはなんとオリジナルのメイド服！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/4"},{"id":"1659618","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"街中で困っている様子の女子高生を見かけるヨーコ。声をかけてみると、それはあの日海辺で出会った少女・ケイトだった。「土下座女」と呼ばれたことに腹をたてるヨーコ。それとは裏腹に、店では楽しい夏祭りイベントが開催される事となる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/5"},{"id":"1659619","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"『なんでも手伝います』ポスターを貼っていたヨーコとマリナ。落ち込んだ芽留と一緒に現れたのは、海辺で出会った女子校生のもう片方であるイクミだった。芽留は飼いネコの《ここあ》を探して欲しいとヨーコたちに依頼する。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-02-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/6"},{"id":"1659620","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ここあを探すヨーコ。ベンチの下をのぞき、顔を上げるとそこにはちょうどここあの姿が！ しかし……ここあは何かに気付き走り出してしまう。慌てて追おうとするヨーコだったが、そこにいたのはケイトで――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/7"},{"id":"1659621","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ケイトと喧嘩してしまい、ぐったりなヨーコ。レイニーカラーでは芽留とイクミが猫探しのポスターを描いていた。イクミは話しを聞くと、ケイトを「言葉選びが下手なの」と擁護する。納得いかないヨーコだが、とあることに少し違和感を感じ……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-02-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/8"},{"id":"1659622","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"落ち込んだヨーコの気分転換のため、束の間の休日にやってきたのは野外プール！ 二人乗りの浮き輪で泳ぐマリナとノンに、ヨーコはいたずらを仕掛ける。が、それにノンが珍しく怒りだし……そして仕返しされたヨーコは着ていた水着が――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-03-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/9"},{"id":"1659623","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"レイニーカラー閉店後、一人でココアを探しに出かけるヨーコ。以前ここあを見かけた公園のその先。たどり着いたのはとある高級マンションの駐車場で……。しかしそこに居たのは、あの日喧嘩したっきりになっていたケイトだった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-03-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/10"},{"id":"1659624","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"勢いよく開いた店の扉。入ってくる芽留。ヨーコたちが囲むダンボールの中にはココアの姿が！ 思わず涙する芽留の様子を微笑ましく見守る一同。一方ヨーコとケイトも和解したようだが、やはりヨーコはイマイチ素直になれず……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-03-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/11"},{"id":"1659625","seasonNumber":5,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"天見家で行われるパーティーに、ケイトとイクミが招かれる。出迎えたヨーコ、マリナ、ノンはなんとパジャマ姿！ ケイトとイクミも着替えると、華やかなパジャマパーティーが始まる。しかしヨーコとケイトはなぜか一緒にお風呂へ入ることに!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2019-03-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":2,"stills":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68482/season/5","name":{"value":"Stagione 5","language":"it-IT"},"year":2019,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4iHtICzNqEQgyYwg2JWbEQEDEAY.jpg"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"missing","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793455789418,"status":"mis